                </span>
              ))}
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="challenge" class="rf-section">
      <div class="rf-wrap rf-two">
        <div>
          <p class="rf-eyebrow">01 / THE CHALLENGE</p>
          <h2>Not every roofing lead is <em>a roofing opportunity.</em></h2>
        </div>
        <div class="rf-copy">
          <p>Your estimators don't need more inquiries from the wrong service areas, poor-fit projects, or people who never respond.</p>
          <p>They need the right project details, a clear next step, and a reliable process for following up.</p>
          <div class="rf-rule">
            <strong>The objective</strong>
            <p>Turn relevant roofing inquiries into actual sales conversations, rather than optimizing only for form submissions.</p>
          </div>
          <figure class="rf-work-photo">
            <img src="/images/roofing/replacement.jpg"
                 alt="Roofing contractor working on a residential roof"
                 loading="lazy" width="900" height="1200" />
            <figcaption>Real roofing work. Better-qualified project inquiries.</figcaption>
          </figure>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="system" class="rf-section rf-dark">
      <div class="rf-wrap">
        <p class="rf-eyebrow">02 / THE SYSTEM</p>
        <h2>From first click to <em>booked inspection.</em></h2>
        <p class="rf-section-intro">Hover over a stage to preview the process, or click to select.</p>
        <div class="rf-stages">
          {stages.map((stage, i) => (
            <button
              type="button"
              class="rf-stage"
              data-stage={i}
              aria-pressed={i === 0 ? "true" : "false"}
            >
              <small>0{i + 1}</small>
              <strong>{stage.title}</strong>
              <span>{stage.label}</span>
            </button>
          ))}
        </div>
        <div class="rf-stage-detail" aria-live="polite">
          <span id="rf-stage-number">STEP 01 / 04</span>
          <h3 id="rf-stage-title">{stages[0].title}</h3>
          <p id="rf-stage-description">{stages[0].detail}</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>


    <!-- ROOFING_HOVER_V3 -->
    <section class="rf-section rf-qualification" id="qualification">
      <div class="rf-wrap">
        <p class="rf-eyebrow">PROJECT QUALIFICATION</p>
        <h2>Different roofing projects.<br /><em>Different sales journeys.</em></h2>
        <p class="rf-qualification-intro">
          A commercial roof replacement shouldn't follow the same process as
          an urgent residential inspection. Explore how qualification changes.
        </p>

        <div class="rf-project-types" aria-label="Roofing project examples">
          <button type="button" class="rf-project-type" data-roof-type="0" aria-pressed="true">
            <img class="rf-project-photo" src="/images/roofing/replacement.jpg" alt="Residential roof installation" loading="lazy" width="700" height="450" />
            <small>01 / RESIDENTIAL</small>
            <strong>Roof replacements</strong>
            <span>Homeowners & major projects ↗</span>
          </button>
          <button type="button" class="rf-project-type" data-roof-type="1" aria-pressed="false">
            <img class="rf-project-photo" src="/images/roofing/roof-detail.jpg" alt="Roofing material installation" loading="lazy" width="700" height="450" />
            <small>02 / COMMERCIAL</small>
            <strong>Commercial roofing</strong>
            <span>Property managers & businesses ↗</span>
          </button>
          <button type="button" class="rf-project-type" data-roof-type="2" aria-pressed="false">
            <img class="rf-project-photo" src="/images/roofing/installation.jpg" alt="Professional roofing crew at work" loading="lazy" width="700" height="450" />
            <small>03 / STORM DAMAGE</small>
            <strong>Inspection requests</strong>
            <span>Urgent property assessments ↗</span>
          </button>
        </div>

        <div class="rf-project-drawer" aria-live="polite">
          <div>
            <span class="rf-drawer-label">EXAMPLE / QUALIFICATION WORKFLOW</span>
            <h3 id="rf-roof-title">Residential roof replacement</h3>
            <p id="rf-roof-description">
              Identify the property owner and collect project details
              before routing an inspection request to an estimator.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="rf-qualification-questions" id="rf-roof-questions">
            <span>Property ownership and location</span>
            <span>Roof age and replacement requirements</span>
            <span>Project timeframe and inspection availability</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="rf-demo-disclosure">
          Illustrative qualification experience — not actual roofing client results.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="calculator" class="rf-section rf-calculator-section">
      <div class="rf-wrap rf-two">
        <div>
          <p class="rf-eyebrow">03 / THE NUMBERS</p>
          <h2>What could better conversion mean <em>for your business?</em></h2>
          <p class="rf-copy">Explore different lead volumes, project values, and close rates. The figures are hypothetical, not performance forecasts.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rf-calculator">
          <span class="rf-calculator-label">INTERACTIVE REVENUE SCENARIO</span>

          <label for="rf-value">Average roofing project <output id="rf-value-output">$15,000</output></label>
          <input id="rf-value" type="range" min="5000" max="50000" step="1000" value="15000" />

          <label for="rf-leads">Qualified monthly leads <output id="rf-leads-output">40</output></label>
          <input id="rf-leads" type="range" min="10" max="150" step="5" value="40" />

          <label for="rf-close">Close rate <output id="rf-close-output">20%</output></label>
          <input id="rf-close" type="range" min="5" max="50" step="5" value="20" />

          <div class="rf-results">
            <div><span>ESTIMATED PROJECTS</span><strong id="rf-projects">8</strong></div>
            <div><span>POTENTIAL GROSS SALES</span><strong id="rf-sales">$120,000</strong></div>
          </div>
          <p class="rf-fineprint">Illustrative gross sales only. Excludes expenses and does not represent expected results, profit, or a revenue guarantee.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="rf-section">
      <div class="rf-wrap">
        <p class="rf-eyebrow">04 / WHAT WE BUILD</p>
        <h2>One connected system.<br /><em>Not disconnected services.</em></h2>
        <div class="rf-features">
          <article><small>01 / ATTRACT</small><h3>Performance marketing</h3><p>Intent-focused Google campaigns and Meta advertising, aligned to relevant roofing services and locations.</p></article>
          <article><small>02 / CONVERT</small><h3>Roofing quote funnels</h3><p>Focused landing pages that capture property details, project fit and clear next steps.</p></article>
          <article><small>03 / FOLLOW THROUGH</small><h3>CRM & appointment systems</h3><p>Lead routing, timely notifications, follow-up workflows and inspection scheduling.</p></article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    
<!-- RF_FINAL_ROOFING_SEO_V3 -->
<section
  id="roofing-lead-generation-company"
  class="rf-section rf-commercial-intent"
  aria-labelledby="rf-commercial-heading"
>
  <div class="rf-wrap">
    <p class="rf-eyebrow">
      ROOFING LEAD GENERATION SERVICES
    </p>

    <h2 id="rf-commercial-heading">
      A roofing lead generation company should
      do more than deliver names.
    </h2>

    <p>
      LeadsFlo helps established U.S. roofing contractors
      attract qualified roofing inquiries using Google Ads,
      Facebook and Instagram advertising, roofing quote
      funnels, CRM automation and inspection booking.
    </p>

    <p>
      Rather than simply buying shared roofing leads for sale,
      contractors can build a connected acquisition and
      follow-up system tailored to their service area
      and preferred roofing projects.
    </p>

    <h3>Residential and commercial roofing lead generation</h3>

    <p>
      Residential replacements, repairs and commercial
      roofing projects involve different buyers.
      Commercial roofing lead generation can require
      building information, roofing system details,
      project scope, decision-maker and timeline.
    </p>

    <p>
      Campaigns and qualification rules should match
      the roofing services a contractor actually offers.
      The objective is to provide useful project context
      before an estimator contacts the prospect.
    </p>

    <h3>What are qualified roofing leads?</h3>

    <p>
      Qualified roofing leads meet agreed criteria such as
      service area, project type, property details,
      timing and contactability. Qualification improves
      the handoff to your sales team but cannot guarantee
      a booking or sale.
    </p>

    <p>
      Read our
      <a href="/insights/roofing-lead-generation/">
        roofing lead generation guide
      </a>
      and our guide to
      <a href="/insights/roofing-lead-costs/">
        roofing lead costs
      </a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="rf-section rf-faq" id="questions">
      <div class="rf-wrap rf-two">
        <div><p class="rf-eyebrow">05 / QUESTIONS</p><h2>Good questions deserve <em>clear answers.</em></h2></div>
        <div>
          {questions.map(({q,a}) => (
            <details class="rf-question">
              <summary>{q}<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
